Trader
======

This project includes seed skill content adapted from the Vibe-Trading project.

Vibe-Trading: https://github.com/Vibe-Trading/Vibe-Trading
License: MIT (Copyright (c) 2026 Vibe-Trading Contributors)

The seed skill markdown files in `packages/db/seed/skills/` are Chinese-language
rewrites and adaptations of methodology concepts from the Vibe-Trading skills
library, tailored to this project's single-user position-monitoring context.
They are not direct translations of the original English text.

Affected files:
  - packages/db/seed/skills/candlestick.md
  - packages/db/seed/skills/risk-checklist.md
  - packages/db/seed/skills/behavioral-finance.md
  - packages/db/seed/skills/valuation-basic.md

The file `packages/db/seed/skills/reference-price-management.md` is original to
this project and is not derived from Vibe-Trading.
